<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY THREE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY THREE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the third day of the Hopman Cup mixed team tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Australia beat 4-France 2-1</p>
<p>Singles (Australian names first)</p>
<p>Nicole Bradtke lost to Mary Pierce 6-7 (6-8) 1-6</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis beat Guy Forget 7-6 (7-1) 6-2</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Philippoussis/Bradtke beat Forget/Pierce 7-6 (9-7) 7-6 (7-5).</p>
</text>
